# Public config for the AI assistant widget. GATSBY_AGENT_URL is a plain
# URL; GATSBY_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY is a Cloudflare Turnstile *site* key, which
# is public by design (the matching secret key lives only in the gateway's
# own .env on the VM, never here).
#
# Fill in GATSBY_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY locally once it exists — it is left
# blank here on purpose. With it blank, Turnstile fails to load and the
# widget falls back to the four static buttons, which is the correct and
# safe default until a real key is set.
GATSBY_AGENT_URL=https://agent.sendmsg.co.il
GATSBY_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY=
